---
// src/pages/wave-genetics/index.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Hub III: Wave Genetics | Anuhazi"
  description="Connect the Pleromic Root Code to biological hardware. Examine holographic DNA, the Phantom DNA effect, and language as an epigenetic laser."
>
  <div class="site-wrapper section theme-void" style="padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 80px;">

    <!-- Wayfinding Breadcrumb Conduit (Gold Path) -->
    <nav class="anu-wayfinding-conduit" aria-label="Hub Navigation">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail">
        <li><a href="/">↵ The Root Code</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page">Hub III: Wave Genetics</li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hub Hero Header (Gold Theme) -->
    <header class="anu-hub-hero reveal">
      <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">The Holy-Reconciling Force</span>
      <h1>Wave Genetics</h1>
      <p class="hero-description" style="color: var(--anu-parchment); font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem); max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8;">
        Connect the Pleromic Root Code to the biological hardware. Examine the physics of holographic DNA, the Phantom DNA effect, and language as an epigenetic laser capable of mutating or repairing the localized antenna.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Context / Callout Aside (The Hardware Synthesis) -->
    <section class="reveal reveal-delay-1 central-aside-wrapper">
      <aside class="anu-terminal anu-terminal-gold">
        <h2>The Hardware Synthesis</h2>
        <p>
          Orthodox science views DNA as a closed, biochemical hard drive, dismissing 98% of the genome as "junk" simply because it does not code for physical proteins. The Sovereign Theurgist recognizes this 98% for what it truly is: a hyper-advanced, multi-dimensional scalar receiver.
        </p>
        <p class="spacing-bottom-none">
          Synthesizing the acoustic geometry of Hub I with the linguistic understanding of Hub II reveals the ultimate esoteric mechanism. Spoken language and acoustic frequencies are literally absorbed by the DNA helix, translating sound into holographic light. Your biology is an active text, constantly being rewritten by the frequencies you ingest and broadcast.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <!-- Node Grid (Gold Cards) -->
    <div class="anu-container anu-grid reveal reveal-delay-2 grid-spacing-bottom">
      
      <!-- Node 3.1 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Node 3.1</span>
        <h3>The Holographic Antenna</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Deconstruct the chemical hallucination. Explore how the 12-strand DNA functions as a biological transceiver, reading and projecting scalar standing waves to interface with the Kathara grid.
        </p>
        <a href="/wave-genetics/the-holographic-antenna/" class="anu-card-link">Compile Data &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Node 3.2 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Node 3.2</span>
        <h3>Epigenetic Linguistics</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Analyze Dr. Peter Gariaev's laboratory data. Discover how spoken words and acoustic frequencies act as a literal laser, rewriting the genetic code and healing or mutating the biological hardware.
        </p>
        <a href="/wave-genetics/epigenetic-linguistics/" class="anu-card-link">Compile Data &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Node 3.3 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Node 3.3</span>
        <h3>The Phantom Matrix</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Examine the Phantom DNA Effect. Understand how the energetic blueprint of the hardware remains in the vacuum even when physical matter is removed, proving the primacy of the wave.
        </p>
        <a href="/wave-genetics/the-phantom-matrix/" class="anu-card-link">Compile Data &rarr;</a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <hr class="anu-divider central-divider reveal reveal-delay-3" />

    <!-- Hub Transit Link (Reconciling Force) -->
    <nav class="reveal reveal-delay-3 anu-hub-transition">
      <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">The First Conscious Shock Awaits</span>
      <a href="/somatic-praxis/" class="anu-btn anu-btn-ghost">
        Engage Hub IV: Somatic Praxis &rarr;
      </a>
    </nav>

  </div>
</Layout>